title=\"image011(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Features</strong></p><p>1.The motor and the pump united as one, working under water, more reliable.</p><p>2.No special requirements for the well casing and lifting pipe. (It can work in Steel tubular well, lime well,  earth well etc. Within the reasonable pressure range, steel tube, rubber tube and plastic hose can be used as lifting pipe.)</p><p>3.Easy to install, operate and maintain, less space demand, no pump house needed.</p><p>4.Simple structure, less cost.</p><p><strong>5. Application</strong></p><p>1.Ground water suction equipment</p><p>2.Water lifting in rivers, reservoirs and Canals</p><p>3.Agriculture irrigation</p><p>4.Water supply for human and animal in plateau and mountain area</p><p>5.Water drainage in city, factories, railway system, mining area and construction site</p><p>6.Water supply equipment in any possible places</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231344153588405.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>Q1:Can I have a sample order for it?</strong></p><p>A: Warmly welcome of sample order to test and check quality. Mixed samples are acceptable.</p><p><strong>Q2: What's your payment terms?</strong></p><p>A: T/T &amp; L/C. Small amount accept paypal. Big amount is OK for 30% down payment &amp; balance against copy bill of loading. For more need, please just contact us and we will reply within 24hours on working days.</p><p><strong>Q3: Do you offer guarantee for the products?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, we offer 12 months warranty to our products &amp; 1% wear out parts for after service.</p><p><strong>Q4: Do you have any MOQ limit for order?</strong></p><p>A. No MOQ, 1pc for sample checking is available.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 3.5 inch submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n